&lt;p&gt;This device sits on your desk or wall, displaying a simple challenge: &amp;ldquo;WYAO&amp;rdquo; (Work Your A** Off). When you complete your habit (e.g., a workout, a study session, a task), you press the button. The screen rewards you with your current statistics, reinforcing your progress, before silently reverting to its challenge mode.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>